ellers move with confidence.\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"boot-screen\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"boot-screen-frame\"></div><div class=\"boot-screen-content\"><p class=\"boot-screen-message\">You&#x27;re at the perfect place for<span>Fox Cities real estate talk!</span></p></div><span class=\"boot-screen-index\">Fox Cities, Wisconsin</span></div><div class=\"page-transition-overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"page-transition-frame\"></div><span class=\"page-transition-mark\">L</span></div><div class=\"site site--loading\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"site-header-inner\"><a class=\"site-logo\" aria-label=\"Lathrop Team Home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"logos/1.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">Lathrop Team</span></a><nav class=\"site-nav-wrap\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><div class=\"site-nav-desktop\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/buy\">Buy</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/sell\">Sell</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Home Valuation</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/communities\">Communities</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/team\">Team</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div><button class=\"site-nav-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_4pb_\"><span class=\"site-nav-toggle-label\">Menu</span><span class=\"site-nav-toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span></span></button><div id=\"_R_4pb_\" class=\"site-nav-mobile\"><div class=\"site-nav-mobile-inner\"><div class=\"site-nav-mobile-links\"><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/buy\"><span>Buy</span><span>01</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/sell\"><span>Sell</span><span>02</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/home-valuation\"><span>Home Valuation</span><span>03</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/communities\"><span>Communities</span><span>04</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/team\"><span>Team</span><span>05</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/about\"><span>About</span><span>06</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Contact</span><span>07</span></a></div><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-cta\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Get your home value <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></nav></div></header><main class=\"site-main\"><section class=\"home-hero\"><div class=\"home-hero-background\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img class=\"home-hero-fallback-image\" src=\"/hero/hero.jpg\" alt=\"\"/></div><div class=\"home-hero-overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"home-hero-content\"><p class=\"hero-eyebrow\">Lathrop Team<span class=\"hero-eyebrow-rule\"></span>Fox Cities, Wisconsin</p><h1 class=\"hero-title\"><span>Fox Cities</span><span>Real Estate,</span><em>Refined.</em></h1><p class=\"hero-description\">Three generations of local expertise, a RealTrends verified performance record, and 525+ five-star reviews guiding you home.</p><p class=\"hero-affiliation\">Proudly affiliated with Keller Williams Fox Cities.</p><div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--light\" href=\"/buy\">Find your next home</a><a class=\"btn btn--outline-light\" href=\"/home-valuation\">See what your home is worth</a></div></div><div class=\"home-hero-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>01</span><span class=\"home-hero-index-line\"></span><span>Fox Cities</span></div><div class=\"home-hero-scroll\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Scroll to explore</span><span class=\"home-hero-scroll-line\"></span></div></section><section class=\"trust-strip\" aria-label=\"Lathrop Team statistics\"><div class=\"trust-strip-intro\"><span class=\"section-eyebrow\">A proven record</span><span class=\"trust-strip-intro-line\"></span></div><div class=\"trust-strip-stats\"><div class=\"trust-stat\"><span class=\"trust-stat-value\">0<!-- -->+</span><span class=\"trust-stat-label\">Years of experience</span></div><div class=\"trust-stat\"><span class=\"trust-stat-value\">$<!-- -->0.00<!-- -->M</span><span class=\"trust-stat-label\">Volume in 2024</span></div><div class=\"trust-stat\"><span class=\"trust-stat-value\">0</span><span class=\"trust-stat-label\">Transaction sides in 2024</span></div><div class=\"trust-stat\"><span class=\"trust-stat-value\">0<!-- -->+</span><span class=\"trust-stat-label\">Five-star reviews</span></div></div></section><section class=\"home-intro\"><div class=\"home-intro-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>03</span><span>Generations</span></div><div class=\"home-intro-content\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">A family helping families</p><h2 class=\"home-section-title\">Experience that feels personal.</h2></div><div class=\"\"><div class=\"home-intro-copy\"><p>The Lathrop Team combines the wisdom of decades in the market with the energy of a new generation of agents.</p><p>We’re a family-run team that has helped hundreds of families buy and sell in Appleton and the surrounding Fox Cities communities. Every transaction receives the structure, data, and personal attention it deserves.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/about\">Discover our story<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"home-featured\"><div class=\"home-featured-heading\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Featured home</p><h2 class=\"home-section-title\">Find a place<br/>worth coming home to.</h2></div><div class=\"\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/buy\">Explore available homes<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div><div class=\"home-featured-visual\"><div class=\"home-featured-image-frame\"><img src=\"/hero/hero.jpg\" alt=\"Fox Cities property\" class=\"home-featured-image\"/><div class=\"home-featured-image-label\"><span>01</span><span>Fox Cities property</span></div></div><div class=\"home-featured-placeholder\"><span>Featured home</span><p>Listing details will be connected here later.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"home-pathways\"><div class=\"home-pathway home-pathway--buy\"><div class=\"home-pathway-number\">01</div><div class=\"\"><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">For buyers</p><h2 class=\"home-pathway-title\">Find your<br/>next chapter.</h2><p class=\"home-pathway-copy\">From the first search to the final signature, we bring local knowledge, clear advice, and steady support to the buying process.</p><a class=\"btn btn--light\" href=\"/buy\">Start your home search</a></div></div><div class=\"home-pathway home-pathway--sell\"><div class=\"home-pathway-number\">02</div><div class=\"\"><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">For sellers</p><h2 class=\"home-pathway-title\">Move forward<br/>with confidence.</h2><p class=\"home-pathway-copy\">From valuation and preparation to marketing and negotiation, we create a clear plan for your sale and manage every detail with care.</p><a class=\"btn btn--outline-light\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Get your home valuation</a></div></div></section><section class=\"home-communities\"><div class=\"home-communities-header\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Where we work</p><h2 class=\"home-section-title\">The Fox Cities,<br/>with local perspective.</h2></div><div class=\"\"><div class=\"home-communities-description\"><p>Each community has its own rhythm, character, and opportunities. We’ll help you understand the details before you make a decision.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/communities\">Explore communities<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></div><div class=\"\"><div class=\"home-community-rail\"><a class=\"home-community-card\" href=\"/communities#appleton\"><span class=\"home-community-index\">01</span><span class=\"home-community-name\">Appleton</span><span class=\"home-community-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"home-community-card\" href=\"/communities#neenah\"><span class=\"home-community-index\">02</span><span class=\"home-community-name\">Neenah</span><span class=\"home-community-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"home-community-card\" href=\"/communities#menasha\"><span class=\"home-community-index\">03</span><span class=\"home-community-name\">Menasha</span><span class=\"home-community-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"home-community-card\" href=\"/communities#kaukauna\"><span class=\"home-community-index\">04</span><span class=\"home-community-name\">Kaukauna</span><span class=\"home-community-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"home-community-card\" href=\"/communities#kimberly\"><span class=\"home-community-index\">05</span><span class=\"home-community-name\">Kimberly</span><span class=\"home-community-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"home-community-card\" href=\"/communities#little-chute\"><span class=\"home-community-index\">06</span><span class=\"home-community-name\">Little Chute</span><span class=\"home-community-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"home-community-card\" href=\"/communities#greenville\"><span class=\"home-community-index\">07</span><span class=\"home-community-name\">Greenville</span><span class=\"home-community-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"home-community-card\" href=\"/communities#oshkosh\"><span class=\"home-community-index\">08</span><span class=\"home-community-name\">Oshkosh</span><span class=\"home-community-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></section><section id=\"reviews\" class=\"home-client-reviews\" aria-labelledby=\"home-client-reviews-title\"><div class=\"home-client-reviews-heading\"><div><p class=\"home-client-reviews-eyebrow\">Client perspective</p><h2 id=\"home-client-reviews-title\">Trust is built<em>one move at a time.</em></h2></div><div class=\"home-client-reviews-intro\"><p class=\"home-client-reviews-count\">525+<span>five-star reviews</span></p><p class=\"home-client-reviews-summary\">Results matter, but so does the experience of getting there. Our goal is for you to feel informed, supported, and confident in the decisions ahead.</p></div></div><div class=\"home-client-reviews-grid\"><figure class=\"home-client-review-card\"><span class=\"home-client-review-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><blockquote class=\"home-client-review-quote\"><p>Shane is a great realtor! I had a wonderful experience with him and would suggest him to anyone looking for a knowledgeable realtor. He took the time to explain the home buying process and would point out and teach about aspects of home building and home buying. He was always available for showings and to answer any questions. He made my first home buying experience and very positive one!</p></blockquote><figcaption class=\"home-client-review-author\">Corey Miller</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"home-client-review-card\"><span class=\"home-client-review-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><blockquote class=\"home-client-review-quote\"><p>I’ll never stop suggesting the Lathrop team. Shane and Diane were amazing to work with, especially during the trying time of buying a house in this market. Shane was so patient and never made us feel bad for some of our hesitations. This team is honest and not pushy, which is very very appreciated. Shane and the Lathrop team will be the only realtors we use for the rest of our home buying/selling time and the only ones we recommend. 10/10</p></blockquote><figcaption class=\"home-client-review-author\">Kayla Fischer</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"home-client-review-card\"><span class=\"home-client-review-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><blockquote class=\"home-client-review-quote\"><p>I had an outstanding experience working with Oliver. After my previous realtor struggled for nearly a year to find tenants for my commercial rental properties, Oliver stepped in and had both units rented in a very short time. His communication, professionalism, and knowledge of the local market made the entire process smooth and stress-free. I highly recommend Oliver and his team to anyone looking for a realtor who truly gets results.</p></blockquote><figcaption class=\"home-client-review-author\">Julie</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"home-client-review-card\"><span class=\"home-client-review-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><blockquote class=\"home-client-review-quote\"><p>The entire Lathrop Team, especially Oliver, was extremely helpful in helping me and my fiance find our first home. They were honest and helped us look for red flags in homes and helped us learn what to look for in a house. As first time home buyers it was great to have some honest guidance, and no pressure on the sales side of things. They were always there, even on short notice to help us. And we found the perfect home to grow in.</p></blockquote><figcaption class=\"home-client-review-author\">Ben Kromanaker</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"home-client-review-card\"><span class=\"home-client-review-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><blockquote class=\"home-client-review-quote\"><p>Thank you Lathrop team for helping us sell our home and finding our forever home! Your professional guidance and suggestions helped so much with this process. Your work behind the scenes making sure all was going as planned went above and beyond and did not go unnoticed!\nWe certainly chose the right team and couldn’t have done any of this without your help. Always immediate responses to our questions and concerns whether it was a phone call, text or email.\nSharing in our excitement was special!\nThank you Diane, Shane, and Oliver!</p></blockquote><figcaption class=\"home-client-review-author\">Patty Managan</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"home-client-review-card\"><span class=\"home-client-review-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><blockquote class=\"home-client-review-quote\"><p>A real team that’s Easy to work with. Honest and accommodating. Having A wealth of knowledge in services and community, makes the Lathrop’s an easy choice. Thank You for everything!</p></blockquote><figcaption class=\"home-client-review-author\">Larry Martin</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"home-client-reviews-actions\"><p>Whether you are buying, selling, or thinking ahead, we are here to answer questions and help you create a clear plan.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/contact\">Start a conversation</a></div></section><section class=\"home-team\"><div class=\"home-team-image-wrap\"><img src=\"/hero/hero2.jpg\" alt=\"The Fox Cities area served by the Lathrop Team\" class=\"home-team-image\"/><div class=\"home-team-image-caption\"><span>The Lathrop Team</span><span>Appleton, Wisconsin</span></div></div><div class=\"home-team-content\"><div class=\"\"><p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Meet the team</p><h2 class=\"home-section-title\">A family helping<br/>families.</h2><p class=\"home-team-copy\">Diane, Shane, and Oliver Lathrop represent three generations in real estate. That depth shows up in how we price, how we negotiate, and how we support you through the process.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/team\">Meet Diane, Shane, and Oliver<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></section><section id=\"buyers-sellers-guides\" class=\"guides-lead-magnet\" aria-labelledby=\"guides-lead-magnet-title\"><div class=\"guides-lead-magnet-content\"><p class=\"guides-lead-magnet-eyebrow\">Plan your next chapter</p><h2 id=\"guides-lead-magnet-title\">Get the Buyer’s &amp; Seller’s Guides</h2><p class=\"guides-lead-magnet-description\">Submit the form and we’ll send you practical guides to help you make your next move with confidence.</p><p class=\"guides-lead-magnet-delivery\">After submitting, you’ll see a thank-you message here and receive the guides by email.</p></div><div class=\"guides-lead-magnet-form\"><iframe src=\"https://api.leadconnectorhq.com/widget/form/c4gouupwAcYwlKn3nYNS\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;border:none;border-radius:8px\" id=\"inline-c4gouupwAcYwlKn3nYNS\" data-layout=\"{&#x27;id&#x27;:&#x27;INLINE&#x27;}\" data-trigger-type=\"alwaysShow\" data-trigger-value=\"\" data-activation-type=\"alwaysActivated\" data-activation-value=\"\" data-deactivation-type=\"neverDeactivate\" data-deactivation-value=\"\" data-form-name=\"Buyer&#x27;s and Seller&#x27;s Guide\" data-height=\"989\" data-layout-iframe-id=\"inline-c4gouupwAcYwlKn3nYNS\" data-form-id=\"c4gouupwAcYwlKn3nYNS\" data-cookie-consent=\"true\" data-cookie-consent-provider=\"auto\" title=\"Buyer&#x27;s and Seller&#x27;s Guide\"></iframe></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"site-footer-top\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><a class=\"site-logo\" aria-label=\"Lathrop Team Home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logos/1.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">Lathrop Team</span></a><p>A three-generation Fox Cities real estate team bringing local perspective, documented performance, and personal guidance to every move.</p><a class=\"footer-text-link\" href=\"/contact\">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div><div class=\"footer-navigation\"><p class=\"footer-heading\">Explore</p><div class=\"footer-nav-links\"><a href=\"/buy\">Buy</a><a href=\"/sell\">Sell</a><a href=\"/home-valuation\">Home Valuation</a><a href=\"/communities\">Communities</a><a href=\"/team\">Team</a><a href=\"/about\">About</a><a href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div></div><div class=\"footer-contact\"><p class=\"footer-heading\">Direct contact</p><address><p><strong>Diane Lathrop</strong><a href=\"mailto:diane@lathropteam.com\">diane@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:+19204289227\">(920) 428-9227</a></p><p><strong>Shane Lathrop</